 2.3.0 (YYYY-MM-DD)
 ++++++++++++++++++
+
+**Bugfixes**
+
+- Redirects now base each hop on the request as last sent. A POST that a
+  303/301/302 turned into GET no longer reverts to POST when a subsequent
+  hop returns a 307, and an ``Authorization`` header stays stripped once it
+  has been removed for a cross-host redirect.
 
 **API Changes**
 
